<title>JAPAN: Aoki Super -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Aoki Super -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 24.74		vs	   25.61</p>
<p> Operating	  142    million    vs	  189    million</p>
<p> Current	    176    million    vs	  256    million</p>
<p> Net		   91    million    vs	  126    million</p>
